Package: nfsshift-mp
Version: @VERSION@
Section: user/games
Priority: extra
Architecture: armel
Depends: nfsshift
Installed-Size: 0
Maintainer: smatkovi <sebastian.matkovich@gmail.com>
Description: LAN multiplayer add-on for NFS Shift
 Adds the missing network transport to the MeeGo build of Need for Speed
 Shift. A small native library is loaded into the original game process with
 LD_PRELOAD; it patches the game's own multiplayer code at run time and talks
 UDP to other phones on the same Wi-Fi network (port 45470 for discovery,
 45471 for the session). Up to four players, cross-play with the Sailfish OS
 and Android ports.
 .
 The original package "nfsshift" is left completely untouched - this package
 only adds a second launcher called "NFS Shift LAN" next to it. Remove this
 package and the game behaves exactly as before.
 .
 Contains no game data and no game code: the data belongs to the original
 package that is already installed.
Maemo-Display-Name: NFS Shift LAN
